# Generated by nox.sandbox.wfp_helper - do not edit. The installer pins this file's SHA-256.
# Windows PowerShell 5.1 and .NET only: no cmdlet, no module, no file of Nox's is used, so nothing
# a user account can change runs with the administrator rights this step gets.
# Actions: show | status (no administrator) | install | remove | uninstall (administrator).
